AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020022> "A role of an area for decentralized heat supply is a heat plan subarea that is not primarily indented to be supplied by a district heating or natural gas network.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020022> "Section 3(1) no. 10 and Section 28 of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
