# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020024> (role of district heating densification area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020024> "A role of a district heating area in which end users located in the immediate vicinity of an existing heat network are to be connected to it without requiring the expansion of the heat network")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020024> "Section 3(1) no. 18  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
