AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020025> "A role of a district heating area where the area will be connected for the first time to an existing district heating grid through the construction of new heat pipelines.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020025> "Section 3(1) no. 18  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
