# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020026> (projected heat plan subarea)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020026> "A projected heat plan subarea is a heat plan subarea that is either a district heating area, a hydrogen grid area, an area for decentralized heat supply or an area under suitablility assessment.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020026> "Voraussichtliches Wärmeversorgungsgebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020026> "Section 3(1) no. 14  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020026> "projected heat plan subarea"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020026> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
