EquivalentClasses(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020026> ObjectUnionOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013>))
