# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> (district heating area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> "A district heating area is a heat plan subarea in which a district heating network exists or for which it is planned. Whithin this area, a significant proportion of the local end users are to be supplied whith heat via the district heating network.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> "Wärmenetzgebiet"@de)
