# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> (district heating expansion area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "A district heating expansion area is an district heating area that will be connected for the first time to an existing district heating grid through the construction of new heat pipelines.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "Wärmenetzausbaugebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "heat network expansion area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "Section 3(1) no. 18  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "district heating expansion area")
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007>)
DisjointClasses(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> (district heating development area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "A district heating development area is a district heating area that will be connected to a newly developed district heating grid in the future.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "Wärmenetzneubaugebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "heat network development area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "Section 3(1) no. 18  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "A new district heating network is a heating network
a) for which construction begins after December 31, 2023.
b) that, for the first time after January 1, 2024, exceeds the size of a building network
c) for which construction begins for the purpose of network expansion after December 31, 2023, and which is not thermally connected to an existing upstream network, or is connected only to a limited extent, either through a direct hydraulic connection or indirectly via heat transfer.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "district heating development area")
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> (energy saving area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "An energy saving area is a heat plan subarea with an expected increased energy saving potential.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "Energieeinspargebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "Teilgebiete mit erhöhtem Energieeinsparpotenzial"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "Section 136(2) of the German Building Act (BauGB)
Section 18(5)  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "Such areas may be either areas that appear suitable for future designation as redevelopment areas under a separate urban planning decision, as defined in 1 of Part 1 of Chapter 2 of the Building Code; of areas with a high proportion of buildings having high specific final energy consumption for space heating, in which measures to reduce final energy demand are particularly suitable for supporting the transition to a greenhouse gas-neutral heat supply.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "energy saving area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020016>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> (area under suitability assessment)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "An area under suitability assessment is a heat plan subarea that that is being reviewed for the suitability of its future heat supply. It is not assigned to a hydrogen network area, district heating area, nor an area for decentralized heat supply. Reasons for such a suitablility assessment are unclear conditions for such an assignment, or a significant share of the local end users that is expected to be supplied with heat in another way, such as through grid-bound green methane supplied via an existing or planned gas distribution network.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "Prüfgebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "Section 3(1) no. 10 and Section 28 of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "area under suitability assessment"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030014>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030014> (role of area under suitability assessment)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030014> "A role that inheres in a planned heat plan subarea when, within municipal heat planning, the subarea is not assigned to a hydrogen network area, district heating area, or decentralized heat supply area because the conditions required for such an assignment are not yet sufficiently known, or because a significant share of the local end users is expected to be supplied with heat in another way, such as through grid-bound green methane supplied via an existing or planned gas distribution network.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030014> "Section 3(1) no. 10 and Section 28 of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030014> "role of area under suitability assessment"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030014> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030014> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> (area excluded from heat planning)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> "An exclusion area is a heat plan subarea in which certain heat supply potentials are excluded or significantly restricted, such as a water protection area or mineral spring protection area. It is defined in the potential analysis in municipal heat planning.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> "Ausschlussgebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> "Wärmeplanungsausschlussgebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> "excluded area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> "Annex 2, Part II of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> "area excluded from heat planning"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030016> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020014>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030017> (initial suitability assessment)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030017> "A suitability assessment is a descriptive information content entity that documents the initial research of grid bound heat supply, based on available information and stakeholder consultation, whether one or more heat plan subareas are highly likely not suitable for supply by a district heating network or a hydrogen grid.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030017> "Eignungsprüfung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030017> "suitability screeening"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030017> "Section 14  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030017> "initial suitability assessment"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030017> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/17
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/21")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030017> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030017> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001808> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> (shortened heat planning)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> "A shortened heat planning is a descriptive information content entity that documents, in a municipal heat plan, that one or more heat plan subareas are represented as prospective decentralized heat supply areas based on a suitability assessment indicating that they are highly likely not suitable for supply by a district heating network or a hydrogen grid. Only potentials relevant for decentralized heat supply are considered for these subareas.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> "Dokumentation der verkürzten Wärmeplanung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> "shortened heat planning documentation"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> "verkürzte Wärmeplanung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> "Section 14  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> "shortened heat planning"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/17
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/21")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030018> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001808> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>))


DisjointClasses(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020023> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020024> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020025>)
)